LK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30252,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":990090210,"text":"よっ！そこの異郷の武者！","nextNodeIds":[727270102,727270104]},{"nodeId":727270102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2162807338,"text":"また会ったね。","nextNodeIds":[727270103]},{"nodeId":727270103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30252,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":2371709226,"text":"ああ、また会えてうれしいぜ！君の姿は、相変わらずまぶしいな…","nextNodeIds":[727270106]},{"nodeId":727270106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30252,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":10764002,"text":"…コホン。とにかくここ数日、また何者かが「百人一揆」を秘密裏に開催している。","nextNodeIds":[727270107,727270112]},{"nodeId":727270107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2826485450,"text":"「百人一揆」ってなんだっけ？","nextNodeIds":[727270108]},{"nodeId":727270108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30252,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":1350307370,"text":"「百人一揆」は、元々「天狗党人」たちが開催した祭典だった。痛快な戦いを通して、記念すべきことをお祝いしたり、嫌な気持ちを吹き飛ばしたりするのが目的だった。","nextNodeIds":[727270109]},{"nodeId":727270109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30252,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":971505210,"text":"祭典では、武者や魔物といった偏見を捨てて、身分を問わず、ただ熱い戦いを楽しむことができる。","nextNodeIds":[727270110]},{"nodeId":727270110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30252,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":3159338450,"text":"そして祭典で勝利した武者は、様々な財宝を手に入れることができる、と言われている…","nextNodeIds":[727270111]},{"nodeId":727270111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30252,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":2166056282,"text":"…それはそうと、「天狗党」が取り締まられた今、誰が、どこで祭典を開催しているのか、勝者の賞品がどこから来たものかも、俺には分からない。","nextNodeIds":[727270115]},{"nodeId":727270115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30252,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":3958878786,"text":"とにかく、ここは人目が多い。じっくりと話ができないから、前と同じように俺についてきてくれ…","nextNodeIds":[727270116]},{"nodeId":727270116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":133842426,"text":"茅葺一慶はあなたを稲妻城外の島へと連れて行った…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":727270112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3923738194,"text":"…また？","nextNodeIds":[727270113]},{"nodeId":727270113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30252,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":4284628010,"text":"ああ、大勢の人が君の戦う雄姿に憧れ、観衆たちまでもが熱くなった。自ら祭典に参加して、自分の腕を試したい人も出てきているようだ。","nextNodeIds":[727270114]},{"nodeId":727270114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30252,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":2326765866,"text":"実はこんなに早く、今回の「百人一揆」が開催されるとは思わってなかったよ…","nextNodeIds":[727270115]},{"nodeId":727270104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2803012290,"text":"…誰だっけ？","nextNodeIds":[727270105]},{"nodeId":727270105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30252,"speakerName":"茅葺一慶","textMapHash":1167549554,"text":"もう忘れたのか？…ああ、すまん。前回の「百人一揆」の時は戦闘の記録ばっかり取ってたからな、君へ歓声を送れなかったんだ…","nextNodeIds":[727270106]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7272701,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_START","LNHLPKELCAL":["30252"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7272702,"order":2,"stepDescription":"茅葺と会話する","stepDescTextMapHash":516912164,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7272702,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_